# .github/CODEOWNERS — enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the main ruleset.
#
# Why this file exists: on `pull_request` events GitHub runs the workflow file from
# the PR itself, so a PR could rewrite quality-gate.yml to always pass. Code-owner
# review is enforced by GitHub, not by our workflow, so it closes that hole.
# Org plans can also add a ruleset "Require workflows to pass" pinned to the
# default branch for quality-gate.yml.
#
# Replace @your-org/quality-owners with at least two humans (these paths are Tier 2).

/.github/workflows/      @your-org/quality-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @your-org/quality-owners
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md   @your-org/quality-owners
/.github/pull_request_template.md   @your-org/quality-owners
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/     @your-org/quality-owners
/quality.toml            @your-org/quality-owners
/REVIEW.md               @your-org/quality-owners
/AGENTS.md               @your-org/quality-owners
/CLAUDE.md               @your-org/quality-owners
/.claude/                @your-org/quality-owners
/.codex/                 @your-org/quality-owners
/code_quality/           @your-org/quality-owners
